# A fork run out of sight (`start_session` with `context` `fork`, the mock
# model's "fork the stock scan"): the card names the work the fork takes up,
# the copy runs as a delegate with its row under the conversation, knows the
# conversation it was copied from, runs on the session's own model rather
# than the one [ai.subagents] names, and its answer comes back to the agent,
# which quotes it.
config side-models.toml
mock-llm
start
wait "README.md"
key Alt+A
wait "Agent"
key Alt+Home Alt+F11
type "fork the stock scan"
key Enter
wait "I'll fork the stock scan." 20
wait "Agent wants to run start_session" 15
wait "fork: FORKTASK: count the items" 5
snapshot card
type "1"
wait-gone "Agent wants to run start_session" 10
wait "The fork runs in the background." 20
wait-re "^│& Delegating to · default +FORKTASK: count the items" 10
snapshot running
wait "The fork is back: saw the request, on qwen3-coder-30b-a3b" 30
snapshot done
quit
